  "notes": "Extracted from the primary paper (snippet: In the case of no-NH4+ minimal medium, the 1 g/liter (NH4)2SO4 was replaced with 0.2 g/liter MgSO4 to achieve similar molarity.). Component names mapped to BiGG (see mapping_confidence); presence-based bounds unless the paper gave exchange bounds; concentration_mM where units allowed. Extraction confidence: high.",
